{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/ddc541934ce12d22a24a8efc9f887745.poster.avif?t=1774436080\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/ddc541934ce12d22a24a8efc9f887745.webm?t=1774436080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/ddc541934ce12d22a24a8efc9f887745.mp4?t=1774436080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were once an upcoming star of the lucrative Bazhi Empire until the organization you worked for turned on you and sent you on exile. Now, you\u2019re back where it all started: a crumbling village at the edge of the desert, your hometown. But a merchant with nothing to lose only has everything to gain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soukh</strong> is a vibrant blend of shop management, light strategy, and quirky minigames, all set in a world inspired by the rich aesthetics of Middle Eastern and Asian cultures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/43341ed3d4c4cc0d4453722bd9edc30b.poster.avif?t=1774436080\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/43341ed3d4c4cc0d4453722bd9edc30b.webm?t=1774436080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/43341ed3d4c4cc0d4453722bd9edc30b.mp4?t=1774436080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Art of the Hustle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget &quot;set it and forget it&quot; pricing. In a real Soukh, the price is whatever you can talk the customer into paying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulating Soukhs in real life, you have to approach the customer instead of standing behind a cash counter, letting you engage with the customers in real time!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Active Haggling:</strong> Engage in fast-paced minigames to charm, pressure, or out-negotiate your customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crowd Control:</strong> Manage a chaotic market filled with impatient shoppers, silver-tongued rivals, and the occasional thief looking for a freebie.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Market Mastery:</strong> Keep your shelves stocked and your eyes on the trends, or risk being left with a warehouse full of worthless stock.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/0ae5f76f5eaf837edef8c4ba589e362a.poster.avif?t=1774436080\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/0ae5f76f5eaf837edef8c4ba589e362a.webm?t=1774436080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/0ae5f76f5eaf837edef8c4ba589e362a.mp4?t=1774436080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lead the Caravan</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The riches of <strong>Lazaran</strong> won't come to you, you need allies to help you procure the best of the best.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Team:</strong> Recruit and upgrade a roster of  Adventurers and Townsfolk. Promote them to <strong>Advanced Classes</strong> to survive the harsher corners of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/09f0d586a3d7631ca2ea06e9b6ffb01d.poster.avif?t=1774436080\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/09f0d586a3d7631ca2ea06e9b6ffb01d.webm?t=1774436080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/09f0d586a3d7631ca2ea06e9b6ffb01d.mp4?t=1774436080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Expeditions:</strong> Don't just watch a progress bar. Assist your team through unique challenges and skill-based minigames to secure legendary loot! (and maybe a few &quot;stolen&quot; goods). </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/0b3693ea21ffdbe8fea1c1ed9850a5dc.poster.avif?t=1774436080\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/0b3693ea21ffdbe8fea1c1ed9850a5dc.webm?t=1774436080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/0b3693ea21ffdbe8fea1c1ed9850a5dc.mp4?t=1774436080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/7f4b4f2c5f3a7766a9a65326aeb7ee28.poster.avif?t=1774436080\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/7f4b4f2c5f3a7766a9a65326aeb7ee28.webm?t=1774436080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/7f4b4f2c5f3a7766a9a65326aeb7ee28.mp4?t=1774436080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your gold doesn't just sit in a chest. Use your profits to breathe life back into your hometown.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Village Evolution:</strong> Watch your tiny, deserted village transform into a bustling trade hub as you unlock new buildings and attract colorful allies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted Beauty:</strong> Lose yourself in a world of stunning, hand-drawn visuals and a cast of dozens of unique, grumpy, and hilarious characters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/1de603872f03e6cb74096cbb3e9d289e.poster.avif?t=1774436080\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/1de603872f03e6cb74096cbb3e9d289e.webm?t=1774436080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/1de603872f03e6cb74096cbb3e9d289e.mp4?t=1774436080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Energy Management:</strong> A shop-keeping experience where your reflexes are as important as your math.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Progression:</strong> Upgrade your shop, your town, and your caravan roster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Selling:</strong> Use minigames to maximize profit on every single item.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Rich Narrative:</strong> Follow the Merchant's journey from disgraced exile to the King of the Bazaar.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3900970?t=1774436080","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/e129d14e45dc4fd9a1f4aa1ccc6ae68806a96243/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774436080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/2e63feaff186336da46375ac81d2aea36a6fed3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774436080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/2e63feaff186336da46375ac81d2aea36a6fed3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774436080","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/ddc541934ce12d22a24a8efc9f887745.poster.avif?t=1774436080\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/ddc541934ce12d22a24a8efc9f887745.webm?t=1774436080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extra