graph\" ><strong>Crowd Control:</strong> Manage a chaotic market filled with impatient shoppers, silver-tongued rivals, and the occasional thief looking for a freebie.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Market Mastery:</strong> Keep your shelves stocked and your eyes on the trends, or risk being left with a warehouse full of worthless stock.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/0ae5f76f5eaf837edef8c4ba589e362a.poster.avif?t=1774436080\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/0ae5f76f5eaf837edef8c4ba589e362a.webm?t=1774436080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/0ae5f76f5eaf837edef8c4ba589e362a.mp4?t=1774436080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lead the Caravan</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The riches of <strong>Lazaran</strong> won't come to you, you need allies to help you procure the best of the best.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Team:</strong> Recruit and upgrade a roster of  Adventurers and Townsfolk. Promote them to <strong>Advanced Classes</strong> to survive the harsher corners of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/09f0d586a3d7631ca2ea06e9b6ffb01d.poster.avif?t=1774436080\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900970/extras/09f0d586a3d7631ca2ea06e9b6ffb01d.webm?t=1774436080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=